[0m[0m
The translation is a single file, [38;5;10mtranslation/src/main.rs[0m, with no dependencies. The C's behavior lives almost entirely in its four [38;5;10mscanf[0m calls, so most of the work was emulating glibc's [38;5;10mscanf[0m at the byte level over a buffered stdin with unlimited pushback:[0m[0m
[0m[0m
- [38;5;10m%[...][0m scansets do [1mnot[22m skip leading whitespace — only the explicit spaces in the format strings and [38;5;10m%d[0m's built-in skip do. This is why a comment retains the blank separating it from the arrival code, and since [38;5;10mprintf[0m adds another, comments print with two spaces before them.[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mscanf[0m returns [38;5;10mEOF[0m only on input failure [3mbefore the first conversion[23m; a matching failure returns 0, which the C loop does not treat as a stop condition. So malformed records still get appended, reusing whatever the stack buffers held from the previous iteration. I reproduced this by hoisting the buffers out of the loop (they occupy the same stack slots in C), resetting only [38;5;10mcomments[0][0m.[0m[0m
- [38;5;10m%d[0m writes a signed [38;5;10mint[0m through a pointer to [38;5;10munsigned int[0m, so negative timestamps wrap when printed with [38;5;10m%010u[0m. Overflow follows glibc: convert as [38;5;10mlong[0m with [38;5;10mstrtol[0m-style saturation, then truncate to [38;5;10mint[0m.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
The recursive list insert became a [38;5;10mVec[0m insertion before the first strictly-greater timestamp (identical ordering, stable for ties), and [38;5;10msuperseded[0m keeps the original quirk of consulting only the [3mfirst[23m later directive with a matching luggage id rather than all of them.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Two notes on fidelity. [38;5;10mmatches[0m treats any argument beginning with [38;5;10m-[0m as a wildcard, so a literal argument like [38;5;10m-3[0m can never be matched — preserved as-is. And one input class is genuinely unreproducible: when [3mevery[23m conversion fails on the first record, the C prints uninitialized stack bytes, which I verified change run-to-run as the environment size shifts. I model those buffers as zeroed. Excluding that undefined case, the fuzz found zero mismatches.[0m[0m
